WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.584 --> 00:00:14.389
♪♪

00:00:14.389 --> 00:00:15.599
Peter:
I heard it myself.

00:00:15.641 --> 00:00:23.690
♪♪

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:24.900
Peter:
Slaves are free.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:30.989
♪♪

00:00:30.989 --> 00:00:32.199
Gordon:
Says who?

00:00:32.658 --> 00:00:33.659
Lincoln.

00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:41.458
♪♪

00:00:41.458 --> 00:00:42.876
Peter:
We must get to Lincoln's army.

00:00:43.377 --> 00:00:44.378
Peter:
Five days

00:00:44.795 --> 00:00:45.796
Peter:
through the swamp.

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:46.588
♪♪

00:00:46.588 --> 00:00:49.591
There are many ways to die in a
swamp.

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:51.009
♪♪

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:52.427
Peter:
There are many ways to die here.

00:00:52.469 --> 00:00:53.845
♪♪

00:00:53.845 --> 00:00:54.471
(Strikes match)

00:00:54.471 --> 00:00:56.473
♪♪

00:00:56.473 --> 00:00:57.683
Peter:
I will not be afraid.

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:01.603
Peter:
What can a mere man do to me?

00:01:02.813 --> 00:01:03.814
Man:
Follow the sound...

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:04.273
(Cannon fires)

00:01:04.273 --> 00:01:05.607
Man:
...of Lincoln's cannons.

00:01:05.816 --> 00:01:06.650
(Explosion)

00:01:08.652 --> 00:01:09.486
Peter:
My family

00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:11.280
Peter:
is with me

00:01:12.698 --> 00:01:13.532
Peter:
forever.

00:01:13.949 --> 00:01:14.950
(Explosion)

00:01:14.992 --> 00:01:22.499
♪♪

00:01:22.499 --> 00:01:23.041
(Gunshot)

00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:30.716
♪♪

00:01:30.716 --> 00:01:32.968
Peter:
I will look in triumph...

00:01:35.637 --> 00:01:37.055
Peter:
...at my enemies.

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:44.313
♪♪

